  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Ligat, molliculum meri liquorem</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Infundens oleúmque: asellulo illum</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Imponit: comitatur ad tabernam:</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">En en denarii tibi duo, inquit,</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Hospes, tinnuli: age indigentem</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Hunc cibo refice, &amp; mero, &amp; cubili:</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Vt chirurgus eum peritus artis</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Curet, effice: cùm redibo, reddam</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Quicquid solveris. Aptè &amp; eleganter,</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">CAROLE integer, HEIC mihi videris</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">BONO SAMARITANVS ille ZELO:</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Mentis munera cùm tua recordor</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Singula, optima maxima: attaménque</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Cumprimis, aliis mihiq; notæ</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Ardentis pietate christianâ.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Nam quæ vulnera dira, noxiásque</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">Plagas improbitatis ac scelestæ</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">Vitæ; quas Satan, ille latro vastus,</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">Inflixit per originis venenum,</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">Perplures alii in suis propinquis</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">Ridént, prætereunt, velapprobántque:</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Tu, ceu Samaritanus alter, illis,</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">Zelo percitus optimo, medelam,</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">Salutari oleo increpationis,</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">Fragranti monitorum odore, sano</l>
    <l n="26" para="true">Probi consilii mero, exhibere</l>
    <l n="27" para="true">Studebas, pia verba Salomonis</l>
    <l n="28" para="true">Volvens pectore, Thurei vapores</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">Mulcent corda: sed increpans monénsve</l>
    <l n="30" para="true">Fidè, non minùs est suâvis illis:</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Ghosted show-through from the facing page at the right is ignored. Some words in the lowest lines are partly obscured by the page edge; the readings "monénsve" and "suâvis" are uncertain.</notes>
